# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### POST /pets
-  response discriminator property name changed from `petType` to `petType2` for the response status `200`
-  added the optional property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Cat]/petType2` to the response with the `200` status
-  added the optional property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed/oneOf[#/components/schemas/Breed1]/name2` to the response with the `200` status
-  added the optional property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed/oneOf[#/components/schemas/Breed2]/name2` to the response with the `200` status
-  added the optional property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/petType2` to the response with the `200` status
-  removed the optional property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Cat]/petType` from the response with the `200` status
-  removed the optional property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed/oneOf[#/components/schemas/Breed1]/name` from the response with the `200` status
-  removed the optional property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed/oneOf[#/components/schemas/Breed2]/name` from the response with the `200` status
-  removed the optional property `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/petType` from the response with the `200` status
-  response discriminator property name changed for `oneOf[#/components/schemas/Dog]/breed` response property from `name` to `name2` for the response status `200`






